'''Exeggcute''' (Japanese: '''タマタマ''' ''Tamatama'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion.

