==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Forbidden Light|Exeggcute|1}} from the {{TCG|Forbidden Light}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Brilliant Stars|Exeggcute|1}} from the {{TCG|Brilliant Stars}} expansion.
*'''Growth Spurt''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Exeggcute|76}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

